WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.292 --> 00:00:09.708
Twenty-five years
since our first run together.

00:00:09.792 --> 00:00:11.667
Nineteen hundred and nothin'.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:13.333
That's a long time.

00:00:16.708 --> 00:00:18.875
What you doin'
getting mixed up with her?

00:00:19.625 --> 00:00:21.458
You are marvelous, Rose.

00:00:21.542 --> 00:00:23.292
We were married Sunday.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:36.458
I wonder

00:00:37.542 --> 00:00:39.458
what little lady made these?

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:40.958
I did, sir.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.500
Well, brother Phil.

00:01:01.458 --> 00:01:02.875
Open up the gate. Let him out.

00:01:02.958 --> 00:01:05.542
-You sure? He's not ready.
-Go on. Let him out.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.250
He's just a man, Peter.

00:01:11.667 --> 00:01:12.833
Only another man.

00:01:18.417 --> 00:01:21.875
A man is made by patience
and the odds against him.

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:26.333
For what kind of man would I be
if I did not help my mother?

00:01:26.417 --> 00:01:27.875
Peter!

00:01:31.792 --> 00:01:32.833
If I did not save her?

00:01:46.042 --> 00:01:48.917
Sort of a lonesome place
out here, Pete.

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:51.958
Unless you get in
the swing of things.

